<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0083/na_0026> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasSourceGradeRecord> <http://digistrucmed.org/grade-record/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0083/gr_0046> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0083/tu_0003> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "In patients with CCS, clopidogrel 75 mg daily is recommended, in addition to aspirin, for 6 months following coronary stenting, irrespective of stent type, unless a shorter duration (1–3 months) is indicated due to risk or the occurrence of life-threatening bleeding." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0083/tu_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Aspirin 75–100 mg daily is recommended for patients with a previous myocardial infarction or revascularization." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0083/tu_0017> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasSourceGradeRecord> <http://digistrucmed.org/grade-record/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0083/gr_0032> .
