<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0083/e_0008> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ACE inhibitor" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0083/tu_0012> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "A beta-blocker is recommended, in addition to an ACE inhibitor (or an ARNI) and an MRA, for patients with stable, symptomatic HFrEF to reduce the risk of HF hospitalization and death." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0083/na_0003> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/NormativeAssertion> .
